{"id":71188,"date":"2026-10-28T09:25:26","date_gmt":"2026-10-28T09:25:26","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/?post_type=ajde_events&#038;p=71188"},"modified":"2026-10-28T10:27:03","modified_gmt":"2026-10-28T09:27:03","slug":"trail-por-terras-de-fontes-e-lobos","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/trail-por-terras-de-fontes-e-lobos\/","title":{"rendered":"Trail por Terras de Fontes e Lobos 2026"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Trail por Terras de Fontes e Lobos 2026<\/span><\/h2><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">O <strong>Trail por Terras de Fontes e Lobos 2026<\/strong> realiza-se no domingo, <strong>13 de dezembro de 2026<\/strong>, com partida \u00e0s <strong>09h30<\/strong> junto ao <strong>Pavilh\u00e3o Gimnodesportivo do Cov\u00e3o do Lobo<\/strong>, no concelho de <strong>Vagos<\/strong>, distrito de <strong>Aveiro<\/strong>. O evento percorre os trilhos florestais e caminhos rurais da Uni\u00e3o das Freguesias de Fonte de Ange\u00e3o e Cov\u00e3o do Lobo, estando limitado a <strong>400 vagas nas provas de Trail<\/strong>.<\/p><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">O programa desportivo integra tr\u00eas vertentes com partidas escalonadas do Pavilh\u00e3o do Cov\u00e3o do Lobo: o <strong>Trail Longo (~22 km)<\/strong> com partida \u00e0s <strong>09h30<\/strong> (para atletas maiores de 18 anos), o <strong>Trail Curto (~12 km)<\/strong> \u00e0s <strong>09h40<\/strong> (aberto tamb\u00e9m ao escal\u00e3o Juvenil dos 14 aos 17 anos) e a <strong>Caminhada (~8 km)<\/strong> \u00e0s <strong>09h50<\/strong>. O tempo limite regulamentar para concluir as provas de trail \u00e9 de <strong>3h45m<\/strong>.<\/p><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">A organiza\u00e7\u00e3o est\u00e1 a cargo da <strong>Associa\u00e7\u00e3o Ruralidades e Mem\u00f3rias<\/strong> e da <strong>Uni\u00e3o de Freguesias de Fonte de Ange\u00e3o e Cov\u00e3o do Lobo<\/strong>, com o apoio da C\u00e2mara Municipal de Vagos, LobitosBikeTeam e Escuteiros de Fonte de Ange\u00e3o. Todas as inscri\u00e7\u00f5es pagas incluem t-shirt oficial, saco, medalha <em>finisher<\/em> (no Trail), apoio de recupera\u00e7\u00e3o ativa, banhos e <strong>almo\u00e7o conv\u00edvio completo (sopa, bifana, bebida, castanhas e jeropiga)<\/strong>. Consulta o calend\u00e1rio nacional de provas de <a href=\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/trail\/\" style=\"color: #C4B5FD; text-decoration: underline;\">Trail Running em Portugal<\/a>.<\/p><\/div><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2><ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\"><li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Data<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">13 de Dezembro de 2026<\/span><\/li><li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Local, Concelho & Distrito<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">Pavilh\u00e3o Gimnodesportivo de Cov\u00e3o do Lobo, Vagos, Aveiro<\/span><\/li><li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Dist\u00e2ncias<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; 